<title>UK: Century Inns buys PPC pubs for 9.1 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Century Inns buys PPC pubs for 9.1 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British pub operator Century Inns Plc said on Tuesday it had bought 65 tenanted pubs from the Pub Partnership Company for 9.1 million stg.</p>
<p>Century Inns said PPC originally bought the pubs for 13.6 million stg in 1992. Century Inns said it expected the newly-acquired pubs to lift earnings in their first full year of ownership.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
